[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10622.07, "timestamp": "02:57:02", "text": "没有给我发邮件或者问我，因为很多人都被我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10624.55, "timestamp": "02:57:04", "text": "拉黑了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10626.389, "timestamp": "02:57:06", "text": "你不会，你不会关注那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10639.51, "timestamp": "02:57:19", "text": "我就……嗯，我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10642.07, "timestamp": "02:57:22", "text": "该怎么说呢？是啊，我当然可以屏蔽"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10645.51, "timestamp": "02:57:25", "text": "别人，[嗤之以鼻] 但我的意思是，我已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10648.07, "timestamp": "02:57:28", "text": "屏蔽了那些参与其中的人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10651.83, "timestamp": "02:57:31", "text": "至于其他人，不是圈外人，那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10657.03, "timestamp": "02:57:37", "text": "乌合之众，你可以这么说。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10660.389, "timestamp": "02:57:40", "text": "是的，我只是把几个人静音了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10664.469, "timestamp": "02:57:44", "text": "就这些。没有完全屏蔽，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10666.63, "timestamp": "02:57:46", "text": "这很蠢，是的，而且就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10676.613, "timestamp": "02:57:56", "text": "即使被钉在十字架上"}]